  "claim_guardrail": "No equivalence margin was prespecified. Report effect sizes and interval bounds; do not equate a zero-containing interval with formal equivalence. For efficacy and dose-location contrasts the denominator is common-recommendation seed-stratum pairs. A new interval excluding zero where the production interval included zero is only a new nominal separation, not equivalence or preservation of a supported conclusion. This analysis addresses numerical stability, not accuracy or convergence. Paired t Monte Carlo intervals use trial seeds as the only random unit and are conditional on each evaluated fixed fantasy bank. Fantasy-bank seed 1 is a second deterministic numerical arm; two fixed banks do not estimate a between-bank seed distribution.",
